+/*!
+ *  @file       MIDI.hpp
+ *  Project     Arduino MIDI Library
+ *  @brief      MIDI Library for the Arduino - Inline implementations
+ *  @author     Francois Best, lathoub
+ *  @date       24/02/11
+ *  @license    MIT - Copyright (c) 2015 Francois Best
